OL,3,GNEWSACalls to scrap council large goods
OL,4,Acollection fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has called for the
OL,7,Fscrapping of council fees to collect
OL,8,Flarge items to test whether it reduces
OL,9,Ffly-tipping.
OL,11,FGreen Party councillor Matt Williams
OL,12,Fsaid the cost of paying Newcastle City
OL,13,FCouncil to collect sofas, fridges, and
OL,14,Fother large items, which could be up to
OL,15,F#70 per item, was having a damaging
OL,16,Fimpact on families in deprived areas.
OL,18,FOther councils, such as Sunderland,
OL,19,Foffer a free bulky waste collection
OL,20,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
