OL,3,GNEWSACalls to scrap council large goods
OL,4,Acollection fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewcastle's cabinet member for health
OL,7,Fand social Wendy Taylor said a free
OL,8,Fservice could result in increased
OL,9,Fdemand and put pressure on other front
OL,10,Fline services. Councillors agreed to
OL,11,Freview the service.
